  - XGBoost (Tuned)        : MAE:  6,700.4 | RMSE: 13,095.6 | WAPE: 24.55% | R²:  0.4848
    -> Performance Gain    : XGBoost beats Naive by +58.4% and Seasonal Naive by +14.6% in WAPE.
    -> 14-Day Autoregressive Future Demand generated with 80% empirical prediction bounds.

